WEBVTT

00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:03.849
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> Hi, Pia.

00:00:04.341 --> 00:00:05.097
How are you?

00:00:05.876 --> 00:00:06.568
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> Hi, Lin.

00:00:06.819 --> 00:00:08.151
I’m fine, and you?

00:00:08.612 --> 00:00:09.830
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> I’m fine too.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.590
This is Alex. He’s in my class.

00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:16.092
Alex, this is Pia.

00:00:16.618 --> 00:00:17.588
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> Hi, Alex!

00:00:18.104 --> 00:00:18.573
<v><b>Alex:</b></v> Hi.

00:00:19.144 --> 00:00:20.490
What class are you in?

00:00:26.368 --> 00:00:27.377
<v><b>Lin:</b></v> That’s my bus!

00:00:27.883 --> 00:00:30.376
Bye. See you tomorrow!

00:00:30.911 --> 00:00:31.588
<v><b>Alex:</b></v> Bye.

00:00:34.889 --> 00:00:36.419
Where are you from Pia?

00:00:36.896 --> 00:00:38.056
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> I’m from Italy.

00:00:39.835 --> 00:00:41.142
This is my bus stop.

00:00:41.554 --> 00:00:43.739
Bye, Alex. Nice to meet you.

00:00:44.016 --> 00:00:45.760
<v><b>Alex:</b></v> Nice to meet you, too, Pia.

00:00:46.898 --> 00:00:48.425
Er, what’s your phone number?

00:00:49.309 --> 00:00:50.692
<v><b>Pia:</b></v> Sorry, my bus!

00:00:51.058 --> 00:00:54.664
It’s 07365…